From ad5483cbf383318013bfd7bd92d612b48fc18e3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chandan <chandan@medpath.dev>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 18:24:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Split Sample Collection and Sample Tracking into distinct
 pages

Both /dashboard/collection and /dashboard/tracking previously routed
to the same SampleTrackingComponent, so the two sidebar entries
rendered an identical page (same title, breadcrumb, workflow trail,
and lab-wide queue table) regardless of which one was opened.

- Add SampleCollectionComponent: a single-patient task screen for
  the phlebotomist right after Billing (workflow trail, current
  patient tubes, barcode labels, mark-collected flow, empty state
  when no patient/tests are active).
- Trim SampleTrackingComponent down to a pure lab-wide ops dashboard
  (search, filter, sortable queue table, detail panel) with its own
  header/breadcrumb and no leftover single-patient concerns.
- Point the 'collection' route at the new component; 'tracking'
  keeps the trimmed SampleTrackingComponent.
---
